  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is for learners ages six through twelve to benefit from a resilient education system that delivers uninterrupted access to a safe and quality education. The solicitation will indicate that the award will be for a two-year initial phase, but with an intent to renew for a second three-year renewal award phase subject to certain conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
